{"name":"Loch Ness","hex":"#5f6db0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Loch Ness","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A lake in the Great Glen of Scotland, United Kingdom, the second largest in Britain, and with a maximum depth of 226 metres. It is the alleged home of the Loch Ness monster, Nessie."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Loch_Ness"}],"entries":[{"title":"Loch Ness","blocks":[{"text":"Loch Ness is a large freshwater loch in the Scottish Highlands. It takes its name from the River Ness, which flows from the northern end. Loch Ness is best known for claimed sightings of the cryptozoological Loch Ness Monster, also known affectionately as \"Nessie\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/LochNessUrquhart.jpg/330px-LochNessUrquhart.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loch_Ness","wikidata":"Q49650"},{"title":"Loch Ness (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Loch Ness is a 1996 British family drama film starring Ted Danson and Joely Richardson. It was written by John Fusco and directed by John Henderson."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/39/LochNessDVDCover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loch_Ness_(film)","wikidata":"Q3257706"},{"title":"Loch","blocks":[{"text":"Loch is a word meaning \"lake\" or \"sea inlet\" in Scottish and Irish Gaelic, subsequently borrowed into English. In Irish contexts, it often appears in the anglicized form \"lough\". A small loch is sometimes called a lochan. Lochs which connect to the sea may be called \"sea lochs\" or \"sea loughs\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Ben_Lomond_Scotland.jpg/330px-Ben_Lomond_Scotland.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loch","wikidata":"Q1172903"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Loch_Ness.jpg/330px-Loch_Ness.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Loch_Ness.jpg/330px-Loch_Ness.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Map of Loch Ness","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALoch_Ness.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Loch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg/500px-Loch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Loch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg/1280px-Loch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Loch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg/500px-Loch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Urquhart Bay and Loch Ness viewed from Grant's Tower at Urquhart Castle","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALoch_Ness_from_Urquhart_Castle_-_kingsley_-_30-JUN-09.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Fort_Augustus_locks_2017.jpg/250px-Fort_Augustus_locks_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Fort_Augustus_locks_2017.jpg/500px-Fort_Augustus_locks_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Fort_Augustus_locks_2017.jpg/250px-Fort_Augustus_locks_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=th